  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 999 * 111 * 67 * 87 * 2 * 116\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs:\n\nOption 1): ÷ −× + =\n\n999 * 111 * 67 * 87 * 2 * 116 ⇒ 999 ÷ 111 - 67 × 87 + 2 = 116\n\n⇒ __**999 ÷ 111**__ - 67 × 87 + 2 = 116\n\n⇒ 9 - __**67 **____**×**____** 87**__ + 2 = 116\n\n⇒ __**9 + 2**__ - 5829 = 116\n\n⇒ __11** - 5829**__ = 116\n\n⇒ -5818 ≠ 116 (LHS <span style",
